<title>USA: Photocomm names new executives.</title>
<headline>Photocomm names new executives.</headline>
<dateline>SCOTTSDALE, Ariz. 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Photocomm Inc said it named John Coors president and chief executive officer. J. Michael Davis was elected vice president and Jeff Brines was tapped to be chief financial officer, the company said.  </p>
<p>The new management team has extensive experience in the renewable energy industry having served as executive officers of Golden Genesis, a wholly-owned subsidiary of ACX Technologies Inc, a controlling shareholder of Photocomm, the company said.</p>
<p>Photocomm is a manufacturer and marketer of wireless solar electric power systems.</p>
<p>Company spokesmen were not available for comment.</p>
</text>
